{
  "description": "Ground-material palette per town. A town's biome selects a named style (falling back to 'default'); each style lists, per size tier, the weighted floor materials it may be paved with. Small towns bias to dirt, larger ones to cobblestone then brick. Add a style + biomeStyle entry to theme a new town type (e.g. a forest hamlet paved with moss) with no code changes.",
